{
  "title": "Filter standalone ingredient list labels from ingredient lines",
  "description": "While fixing standalone yield/count metadata filtering, the \
pipeline still showed bare non-ingredient list labels being parsed as \
ingredients:\n\
\n\
  - Raw: `Ingredients`; current item: `Ingredients`\n\
  - Raw: `Serve with`; current item: `Serve with`\n\
\n\
